  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Implement stock native startup handshake and initial scene lifecycle by @JezCH in https://github.com/JezCH/OpenRayneo/pull/105\n* Stock native navigation raster request, transfer and phone guidance contracts by @JezCH in https://github.com/JezCH/OpenRayneo/pull/107\n* Wire stock native navigation START/READY/END to real service for stationary verification by @JezCH in https://github.com/JezCH/OpenRayneo/pull/108\n* Recognize actual NAVER guidance lifecycle without fabricating route data by @JezCH in https://github.com/JezCH/OpenRayneo/pull/109\n* Recognize stock NAVER 6.13.1.2 walking guidance source without legacy HUD fallback by @JezCH in https://github.com/JezCH/OpenRayneo/pull/110\n* Connect stock preset taps to opt-in Naver map handoff by @JezCH in https://github.com/JezCH/OpenRayneo/pull/106\n* Recover exact NAVER Now Bar walking turn and route progress observations by @JezCH in https://github.com/JezCH/OpenRayneo/pull/111\n* Fix stock navigation start/close correlation and prevent overlapping active guidance by @JezCH in https://github.com/JezCH/OpenRayneo/pull/112\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/JezCH/OpenRayneo/compare/validation-v1366...validation-v1388",
